; The drum machine's instruments: a file of instruments without a channel
; (a studio). The game lays its channels over it, one a row of steps
; (main.lua, music:play's channels); no player picks it as a song alone.
; The drums are hot_pursuit.mml's from the library (music/).
#title Drum kit
#tempo 124
@kick   triangle freq=130 sweep=-34 sweep_time=0.08 attack=0.001 decay=0.11 sustain=0 release=0.01 volume=0.85 sidechain=0.25
@snare  noise freq=6000 attack=0.001 decay=0.12 sustain=0 release=0.02 lowpass=5000 volume=0.34 duck=0
@hat    noise freq=14000 attack=0.001 decay=0.025 sustain=0 release=0.01 lowpass=6500 volume=0.14 duck=0
; A sample: samples/thump.wav is the engine's own render of one hit of a
; layered bass drum (a sub, a body and a click, by voxcade music), trimmed
; to 0.9 s, 16-bit mono.
; No row plays it yet.
@thump  sample name=thump root=c4 attack=0.001 decay=0 sustain=1 release=0.05 volume=0.8
